Legal texts

The legal texts in this repository are official publications of the Ministry of Justice of Afghanistan:

- the Official Gazette (Jarida-ye Rasmi), as PDFs in the ministry's law database, http://laws.moj.gov.af/
  (Dari text taken from the PDFs' own text layer). The database carries no licence or copyright statement;
  the gazette is the state's official means of making laws known to the public.
- the Constitution of Afghanistan in English, as published by the ministry at
  https://moj.gov.af/en/enforced-constitution-afghanistan (read on 29 October 2026). The page carries no licence
  or copyright statement.

They are reproduced as official publications of the ministry, with attribution to it.

